engine/godot/pull/99938.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-16T15:32:12Z"},"body":"Gives the GHA workflows a bit of a facelift:\r\n- `godot-build` actions now expect specific types; no change in practice, but ensures valid defaults\r\n- `godot-build` no longer has a `tests` section, as its no longer relevant as a standalone variable\r\n- `SCONSFLAGS` renamed to `SCONS_FLAGS` to prevent SCons from parsing it directly\r\n- `sconsflags` renamed to `scons-flags` for uniformity\r\n- `SCONS_FLAGS` and `scons-flags` variables with multiple arguments are now multiline strings; will make tracking future changes on version control much easier\r\n- `dev_mode=yes` added as first argument for all `SCONSFLAGS` environment variables, removing the need to specify the original elements individually & rendering the `tests` matrix variable moot. If a workflow explicitly doesn't want tests, they now pass `tests=no` after to override the alias\r\n- Superfluous matrix arguments were removed where applicable; mostly applies to booleans whose negation is implicit when absent\r\n- Added `brotli=no` to minimal template","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_vi